# EKS module — terraform.tfvars example
#
# Copy the blocks you need into environments/prod/terraform.tfvars
# Documentation: modules/eks/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EKS cluster with managed node group (requires VPC with private subnets)
